    "heading": "Generate Your Scores",
    "lineStart": 1014,
    "lineEnd": 1031
  },
  "section": "2.14",
  "rulesText": "Determine your ability scores by using one of the following three methods. Your GM might prefer you to use a particular one.\n\nStandard Array. Use the following six scores for your abilities: 15, 14, 13, 12, 10, 8.\n\nRandom Generation. Roll four d6s and record the total of the highest three dice. Do this five more times, so you have six numbers.\n\nPoint Cost. You have 27 points to spend on your ability scores. The cost of each score is shown on the Ability Score Point Costs table. For example, a score of 14 costs 7 of your 27 points.\n\nAbility Score Point Costs",
  "relatedTables": [
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/tables/2-14-ability-score-point-costs"
    }
  ]
}
